---
import Page from "../layouts/page.astro";

import Avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.jpg";

import TimeMachine from "../components/props/time-machine.astro";
---

<Page title="About">
    <article>
        <img src={Avatar.src} alt="avatar" class="avatar" />

        <p>
            I am Daru, an engineer who likes <a
                href="https://github.com/tsoding">recreational programming</a
            >. I have interest in operating systems and compilers design,
            reverse-engineering, computer networking and open source in general.
        </p>
        <p>
            My professional work, hobby projects and open source contributions
            are related to IoT devices, reverse-engineering and/or systems
            programming. I've worked with multiple languages in those such as C,
            Rust, Java, Python and TypeScript.
        </p>

        <div class="prop"><TimeMachine width="200px" height="200px" /></div>

        <p>
            Some of my projects, as well as configuration files for my HomeLab
            and scripts I frequently use are on my <a
                href="https://github.com/davnpsh">GitHub</a
            > profile.
        </p>

        <p>
            I am also a fan of horror and sci-fi media, which usually subtly
            inspire some of my projects. Among the media I've consumed the
            following stand out: <i>Steins;Gate</i>, <i>Another</i>, <i
                >Resident Evil</i
            >, <i>Silent Hill</i>, <i>Signalis</i>, etc. Outside of those
            genres, I also enjoy games which have more cinematic experiences
            such as <i>The Last of Us</i> or <i>A Plague Tale</i>.
        </p>

        <p style="clear: both;"></p>
    </article>
</Page>

<style>
    article {
        width: 100%;
        color: white;
        padding: 40px 0;
        font-size: 22px;
    }

    article a {
        color: yellow;
    }

    article .avatar {
        height: 200px;
        float: left;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    article .prop {
        float: right;
    }
</style>
